to an Ayahuasca journey,

00:33:55.867 --> 00:33:59.103 align:start size:94% position:6% line:0%
or others will use a
higher dose of psilocybin,

00:34:00.071 --> 00:34:00.938
or a whole combination

00:34:00.938 --> 00:34:01.773
of different plant

00:34:01.773 --> 00:34:03.174
and medicine compounds,

00:34:03.174 --> 00:34:05.410 align:start size:84% position:16%
that can also be
pretty transformative,

00:34:05.410 --> 00:34:08.479
the problem is a lot
of people will use that

00:34:08.479 --> 00:34:13.484
like as an escape to
just kinda check out,

00:34:14.352 --> 00:34:15.520
take a whole bunch of psilocybin

00:34:15.520 --> 00:34:16.788 align:start size:84% position:16%
and just lose
control of your body

00:34:16.788 --> 00:34:17.922
and float off into
bliss for a while

00:34:17.922 --> 00:34:19.157
to escape the pain of life

00:34:19.157 --> 00:34:21.025
that you should be
confronting head-on

00:34:21.025 --> 00:34:22.427
and dealing with in other ways.

00:34:22.427 --> 00:34:25.263
Or they're not doing the work,

00:34:25.263 --> 00:34:27.899 align:start size:97% position:3%
what's called the
integration work afterwards.

00:34:27.899 --> 00:34:28.733
For me, if I do a plant

00:34:28.733 --> 00:34:29.867
and medicine journey,

00:34:29.867 --> 00:34:31.335
I have like four

00:34:31.335 --> 00:34:32.670 align:start size:94% position:6%
or five days scheduled
afterwards for journaling,

00:34:32.670 --> 00:34:34.038
for self-reflection,

00:34:34.038 --> 00:34:35.206
for deep work

00:34:35.206 --> 00:34:36.240 align:start size:84% position:16%
that doesn't involve
the medicine,

00:34:36.240 --> 00:34:37.809
but that instead involves me

00:34:37.809 --> 00:34:39.410
just like logging my thoughts

00:34:39.410 --> 00:34:40.244
and my feelings

00:34:40.244 --> 00:34:41.345
and my breakthroughs.

00:34:41.345 --> 00:34:42.280
And a lot of people,

00:34:42.280 --> 00:34:43.815
and this is the reason why

00:34:43.815 --> 00:34:46.784
you'll get folks doing like
their 38th Ayahuasca retreat

00:34:46.784 --> 00:34:47.919
and they're still
the same person,

00:34:47.919 --> 00:34:48.753
and you talk to them,

00:34:48.753 --> 00:34:49.587
they're still searching,

00:34:49.587 --> 00:34:50.788
you can see...

00:34:50.788 --> 00:34:52.056 align:start size:84% position:16%
Tell they're still
incomplete, et cetera,

00:34:52.056 --> 00:34:54.559
it's because they're
not doing the work,

00:34:54.559 --> 00:34:56.260
it'd be like...

00:34:56.260 --> 00:34:58.896
Taking a pre-workout supplement

00:35:00.064 --> 00:35:01.899
and then sitting on
the couch, right?

00:35:01.899 --> 00:35:04.202 align:start size:84% position:16%
And not actually going
to the gym, right?

00:35:04.202 --> 00:35:05.703
So that's the problem,

00:35:05.703 --> 00:35:08.539
is I find a lot of people
will use popping a pill

00:35:08.539 --> 00:35:12.844 align:start size:97% position:3%
as an escape without actually
wanting to do the work,

00:35:12.844 --> 00:35:14.078
and then, in my opinion,

00:35:14.078 --> 00:35:15.646 align:start size:81% position:19%
just turns into
the same situation

00:35:15.646 --> 00:35:16.948
as a drug addict

00:35:16.948 --> 00:35:18.883 align:start size:88% position:13%
who's just kind of
shooting up to feel good

00:35:18.883 --> 00:35:20.685
but never actually benefits

00:35:20.685 --> 00:35:23.688 align:start size:94% position:6%
from the intended
purpose of that compound.

00:35:23.688 --> 00:35:26.257
So yeah, for the most part,

00:35:26.257 --> 00:35:27.492
there's a lot of benefits

00:35:27.492 --> 00:35:29.694
to these types of
plant medicines,

00:35:29.694 --> 00:35:32.830
it's just that I think
most of the benefits

00:35:32.830 --> 00:35:37.201
