of them via micro-dosing,

00:35:37.201 --> 00:35:38.436
and then...

00:35:38.436 --> 00:35:39.103
And I have a whole
section about...

00:35:39.103 --> 00:35:40.037
In my book,

00:35:40.037 --> 00:35:41.506
